  "chapter": {
    "number": 66,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(67) For the end, a Psalm of David among the Hymns."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "God be merciful to us, and bless us; and cause his face to shine upon us. Pause.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "That men may know your way on the earth, your salvation among all nations.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let the nations, O God, give thanks to you; let all the nations give thanks to you.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let the nations rejoice and exult, for you shall judge the peoples in equity, and shall guide the nations on the earth. Pause.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let the peoples, O God, give thanks to you; let all the peoples give thanks to you.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The earth has yielded her fruit; let God, our God bless us.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let God bless us; and let all the ends of the earth fear him.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": []
  },
